## P7 · notifications/AlertsList — SwiftUI/HIG parity ✅

Implemented the native SwiftUI version of the web `AlertsListPage` (route `/notifications/alerts`) at full parity — **52/52 parity items**, adaptive across macOS + iOS.

**Delivered** (`apps/apple/Sources/Features/Notifications/`, 11 files + 1 test):
- `@Observable AlertsListPageModel` over an injectable `AlertsListDataSource` seam porting all 7 web hooks; pure `AlertsListAggregation` reproduces the web `useMemo` pipeline.
- 10 panels (6 KPI tiles with prior-period deltas + no-data panel, 7-day stacked **TSBarChart** trend, by-type **TSPieChart** donut, pinned "Watching" rules), filter bar (search + status tabs + chips), paginated alert rows with mark-read/acknowledge/reopen, acknowledge dialog + audit-timeline sheet. `loading/empty/error/success` for every source.
- Navigation: `AppRoute.alerts` + `/notifications/alerts` & `/alerts` aliases + registration.
- 36 web i18n keys added to `Localizable.xcstrings` (zero hardcoded literals).

